{
  "name": "3 - Coder (Gemini)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Coder\nRuns every 20s. Only gets a task once its dependencies (the approved researcher decisions) are done.\n\nThe generated code is in the **Coder Parse** node output (`full`) - open it from the Executions tab. It is not saved to the graph, only the summary is.\n\nSelect credentials: Header Auth on HTTP nodes, Gemini.\n\nAfter a successful build, the summary goes through workflow 4 (memory extraction) so the graph learns entities/facts from it. If that step fails the task still completes.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "9f5065df-d232-44d6-8585-43f76f0dba6b",
